Sell_Concrete_Test
├── when the caller is not an opener
│   └── it should revert
└── when the caller is an opener
    ├── given the contract is halted
    │   └── it should revert
    └── given the contract is not halted
        ├── when the order has expired
        │   └── it should revert
        └── when the order has not expired
            ├── when the position does not exist
            │   └── it should revert
            └── when the position exists
                ├── given its market is disabled
                │   └── it should revert
                └── given its market is enabled
                    ├── given its market is paused
                    │   └── it should revert
                    └── given its market is not paused
                        ├── given the breaker has tripped
                        │   └── it should revert
                        └── given the breaker has not tripped
                            ├── given the position is not open
                            │   └── it should revert
                            └── given the position is open
                                ├── when the signature is not the position's user's
                                │   └── it should revert
                                └── when the signature is the position's user's
                                    ├── when the tick is outside the sell window
                                    │   └── it should revert
                                    └── when the tick is inside the sell window
                                        ├── when the sale lands at or after the end of the bet
                                        │   └── it should revert
                                        └── when the sale lands before the end of the bet
                                            ├── when the tick is too old or from the future
                                            │   └── it should revert
                                            └── when the tick is fresh
                                                ├── when the tick is before the order
                                                │   └── it should revert
                                                └── when the tick is at or after the order
                                                    ├── when the price is not positive
                                                    │   └── it should revert
                                                    └── when the price is positive
                                                        ├── when the price touches the line
                                                        │   └── it should revert
                                                        └── when the price does not touch the line
                                                            ├── when the valuation is above the current payout
                                                            │   └── it should revert
                                                            └── when the valuation is at most the current payout
                                                                ├── when the sale amount exceeds the valuation
                                                                │   └── it should revert
                                                                └── when the sale amount is at most the valuation
                                                                    ├── when the sell fee is above its cap
                                                                    │   └── it should revert
                                                                    └── when the sell fee is at most its cap
                                                                        ├── when the sale amount is below the minimum
                                                                        │   └── it should revert
                                                                        └── when the sale amount is at least the minimum
                                                                            ├── given anyone is owed
                                                                            │   └── it should revert
                                                                            └── given nobody is owed
                                                                                ├── when the pool cannot pay the valuation
                                                                                │   └── it should revert
                                                                                └── when the pool can pay the valuation
                                                                                    ├── when the payout has too little gas
                                                                                    │   └── it should revert
                                                                                    └── when the payout has the gas it needs
                                                                                        ├── given the token refuses the payout
                                                                                        │   ├── it should keep it for the user to claim
                                                                                        │   └── it should still close the position
                                                                                        └── given the token pays
                                                                                            ├── it should close the position
                                                                                            ├── it should move the sale through the books
                                                                                            ├── it should accrue the fees
                                                                                            ├── it should emit {PositionSold}
                                                                                            └── it should pay the user the sale amount, less the winner fee
